   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# H3 Take: text to video\n\nWrite the shot in **H3 Take**. The prompt follows MiniMax's format: `integrated_multimodal_description`, `overall_soundscape`, and `non_diegetic_music`. Press **Run**.\n\n- **H3 Live Preview** plays the whole clip with sound at every step. It needs `taeh3.safetensors` in `models/vae_approx`.\n- For a quick draft, set width 640, height 352, and 4 steps on **BasicScheduler**.\n- To start on a still, connect it to `start_image` and set `anchor` to start. To keep a person the same across shots, connect pictures to `ref_images`.\n- To edit, extend, and arrange many shots, open **H3 Editor** from the sidebar instead. It builds this graph for each clip."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# H3 Take: text to video\n\nWrite the shot in **H3 Take**. The prompt follows MiniMax's format: `integrated_multimodal_description`, `overall_soundscape`, and `non_diegetic_music`. Press **Run**.\n\n- **H3 Live Preview** plays the whole clip with sound at every step. It needs `taeh3.safetensors` in `models/vae_approx`.\n- For a quick draft, set width 640, height 352, and 4 steps on **BasicScheduler**.\n- To start on a still, connect it to `start_image` and set `anchor` to start. To keep a person the same across shots, connect pictures to `ref_images`.\n- To edit, extend, and arrange many shots, open **H3 Editor** from the sidebar instead. It builds this graph for each clip."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
